{"id":"n68133-2-7","stage":4,"title":"외동딸 · 独生女","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n68133-2-7-1","ko":"유민이는 남자 아이들하고 잘 어울려 노네?","zh":"裕敏和男孩子们玩得挺好啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민이는","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"유민이는","audio":"/audio/727cddb4c6676098ab15.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"남자","meaning":"男子，男人","explanation":"남자：男子，男人","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"1","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아이들하고","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；하고：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，了不起地","explanation":"잘：很好地，了不起地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"8","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어울려","meaning":"打成一片","explanation":"어울리다：打成一片；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"어울리다","audio":"/audio/e3eff4fbd4afe320fdac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67048","senseId":"2","lemma":"어울리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"노네?","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c6a3b6d97217b4d8","term":"남자","zh":"男子，男人","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3","entryId":"60865","definition":"作为男性出生的人。","pronunciation":["남자"]},{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，了不起地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"非常好地、优秀地，值得称赞地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"e3eff4fbd4afe320","term":"어울리다","zh":"打成一片","audio":"/audio/e3eff4fbd4afe320fdac.mp3","entryId":"67048","definition":"一起很好地相处，或加入某个群体一同活动。","pronunciation":["어울리다"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"玩耍，玩乐","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"玩着游戏等度过有趣、愉快的时光。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/78674f7851cdfc112caa.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n68133-2-7-2","ko":"응. 오빠들만 있는 외동딸이라서 남자처럼 컸거든.","zh":"嗯，她是家里唯一的女孩，只有哥哥，从小像男孩一样长大。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오빠들만","meaning":"哥哥","explanation":"오빠：哥哥；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"오빠","audio":"/audio/14e10e3b73bff8540288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68006","senseId":"1","lemma":"오빠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"외동딸이라서","meaning":"独生女","explanation":"외동딸：独生女；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라서：名词判断或 아니다 后的原因表达：“因为是、因为不是”。","readings":[{"term":"외동딸","audio":"/audio/dc9459704b84ed816d13.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68133","senseId":"2","lemma":"외동딸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"남자처럼","meaning":"男子，男人","explanation":"남자：男子，男人；처럼：表示相似：“像……一样”。","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"1","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"컸거든.","meaning":"成长","explanation":"크다：成长；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66584","senseId":"2","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"14e10e3b73bff854","term":"오빠","zh":"哥哥","audio":"/audio/14e10e3b73bff8540288.mp3","entryId":"68006","definition":"女子用于指称或称呼兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年长的男性。","pronunciation":["오빠"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"dc9459704b84ed81","term":"외동딸","zh":"独生女","audio":"/audio/dc9459704b84ed816d13.mp3","entryId":"68133","definition":"(昵称)没有其他女儿，只有一个女儿。","pronunciation":["외동딸","웨동딸"]},{"id":"c6a3b6d97217b4d8","term":"남자","zh":"男子，男人","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3","entryId":"60865","definition":"作为男性出生的人。","pronunciation":["남자"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"成长","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66584","definition":"长大成人。","pronunciation":["크다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ed14429c961b49f4bd53.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.72,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=68133","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":133,"sequenceScore":2.5467,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["裕敏和男孩子们玩得挺好啊？","嗯，她是家里唯一的女孩，只有哥哥，从小像男孩一样长大。","为什么想要让敏俊转学呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["裕敏和男孩子们玩得挺好啊？","嗯，她是家里唯一的女孩，只有哥哥，从小像男孩一样长大。","为什么想要让敏俊转学呢？"],"answer":1}]}
